  "instructionsAndroidStep1Title": "Install the WireGuard app",
  "instructionsAndroidStep1Body": "Open Google Play, search for WireGuard, then install it. You only need to do this the first time.",
  "instructionsAndroidStep2Title": "Choose based on the device",
  "instructionsAndroidStep2Body": "• Configuring this device: return to the profile in FAV, tap Save and use the file.\n• Configuring another phone or tablet: leave the QR code visible on this device and scan it from the other one.",
  "instructionsAndroidStep3Title": "Open the WireGuard app",
  "instructionsAndroidStep3Body": "Find the WireGuard icon on your phone and open the app.",
  "instructionsAndroidStep4Title": "Choose the same method in WireGuard",
  "instructionsAndroidStep4Body": "Tap the blue + button, then:\n• File: choose Import from file or archive.\n• QR: choose Scan from QR code.",
  "instructionsAndroidStep5Title": "Complete the import",
  "instructionsAndroidStep5Body": "On the device being configured, select the .conf file or scan the QR code visible on the device running FAV. Do not rename the file: WireGuard uses its name as the tunnel name and accepts only a strict format; FAV's name is already compatible.",
  "instructionsAndroidStep6Title": "Turn on the VPN",
  "instructionsAndroidStep6Body": "Tap the switch next to the profile name to turn the VPN on or off whenever you want.",
  "instructionsIosStep1Title": "Install the WireGuard app",
  "instructionsIosStep1Body": "Open the App Store, search for WireGuard, then install it. You only need to do this the first time.",
  "instructionsIosStep2Title": "Choose based on the device",
  "instructionsIosStep2Body": "• Configuring this iPhone or iPad: return to the profile in FAV, tap Save and use the file.\n• Configuring another iPhone or iPad: leave the QR code visible on the device running FAV and scan it from the other one.",
  "instructionsIosStep3Title": "Open WireGuard",
  "instructionsIosStep3Body": "Open WireGuard and tap + or Add a tunnel, then:\n• File: choose Create from file or archive.\n• QR: choose Create from QR code.",
  "instructionsIosStep4Title": "Import the profile",
  "instructionsIosStep4Body": "On the device being configured, select the .conf file or scan the QR code visible on the device running FAV. Do not rename the file: WireGuard uses its name as the tunnel name and accepts only a strict format; FAV's name is already compatible.",
  "instructionsIosStep5Title": "Turn on the VPN",
  "instructionsIosStep5Body": "Tap the switch next to the profile name to turn the VPN on or off whenever you want.",
  "instructionsQrStep1Title": "Install WireGuard on the other phone",
  "instructionsQrStep1Body": "On the other phone install WireGuard from Google Play (Android) or from the App Store (iPhone).",
  "instructionsQrStep2Title": "Open the WireGuard app",
  "instructionsQrStep2Body": "Open the WireGuard app on the other phone.",
  "instructionsQrStep3Title": "Choose Scan from QR code",
  "instructionsQrStep3Body": "Tap the + button and choose Scan from QR code. Allow camera access if you are asked.",
  "instructionsQrStep4Title": "Point the camera",
  "instructionsQrStep4Body": "Point the camera at the QR code shown on this app's profile screen. Hold the phone steady until the code is read.",
  "instructionsQrStep5Title": "Name and save",
  "instructionsQrStep5Body": "Give the profile a name (if asked) and tap Save.",
  "instructionsQrStep6Title": "Turn on the VPN",
  "instructionsQrStep6Body": "Tap the switch next to the profile name to activate the VPN on the other phone.",
